                                        "entry_id": "80350e55-95ac-3c4f-8c04-020ad972ed2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A corset-like sleeveless overgarment for women, sometimes provided with detachable sleeves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13b19d3a-eacd-3abe-bd5b-3cfad9c2d78f",
                                        "entry_id": "80350e55-95ac-3c4f-8c04-020ad972ed2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A blouse; any shirt for women, particularly the upper part of a two-piece dress or similar European folk costume."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bca37b97-f5b8-432c-83db-32e5e112d87e",
                                                "sense_id": "13b19d3a-eacd-3abe-bd5b-3cfad9c2d78f",
                                                "text": "As she knelt, too, her amber locks fell in rich ringlets about her beautiful head, her innocent bosom palpitated beneath the crimson boddice, and her timid blushes increased the effulgence of her charms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "822524dc-09ba-4ba1-8bfe-917ce4a9f3f2",
                                                "sense_id": "13b19d3a-eacd-3abe-bd5b-3cfad9c2d78f",
                                                "text": "On the cover of the leaflet advertising the Alpenrose Gasthof in Zirl am Gurgl […] there is a decorative picture of a young woman. She is wearing Tyrolese costume: the low-cut white bodice with cross-laced velvet waistcoat, the floral apron and dirndl skirt."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba9d2514-d825-3432-b334-09b7dbadb7e1",
                                        "entry_id": "80350e55-95ac-3c4f-8c04-020ad972ed2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The upper portion of a women's one-piece dress, equivalent to a shirt, sometimes specifically excluding the sleeves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
